classDiagram
    class Task {
        +str description
        +str time
        +str frequency
        +bool completed
        +Pet pet
        +date due_date
        +mark_complete() Task or None
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +list_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +get_all_tasks() list~Task~
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +sort_by_time(tasks: list~Task~) list~Task~
        +filter_tasks(pet_name: str, completed: bool) list~Task~
        +detect_conflicts() list~str~
        +mark_task_complete(task: Task) Task
    }

    Owner "1" o-- "1..*" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" o-- "0..*" Task : manages
    Task --> Pet : assigned to
    Scheduler --> Owner : reads household tasks from
    Scheduler ..> Task : sorts and manages
